  "body": "Looking for a brand-new home that offers more than just four bedrooms?\r\n4 Bedrooms | 3 Bathrooms | 2 Living Areas | Internal Access Garage\r\nStep inside and discover a thoughtfully designed home where space, style and flexibility come together.\r\nFeaturing 4 generous bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and 2 separate living areas, this home has been designed with real family life in mind. Downstairs, enjoy bright and airy open-plan living, dining and a contemporary kitchen, plus a bedroom and full bathroom on the ground floor — perfect for parents, guests, teenagers or working from home.\r\nUpstairs is where the layout really stands out. A second living area gives everyone their own space to relax, alongside three further bedrooms including a master suite with ensuite, plus a family bathroom.\r\nThe location makes it even better. Zoned for Macleans Primary School, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College, and within walking distance of PAK’nSAVE, Lloyd Elsmore Park, local shops and restaurants, everyday convenience is right on your doorstep.\r\nThere are plenty of new builds on the market — but it’s the layout that makes this one different. Come inside and see how well this home works for your family.",
